1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,704
Twenty small purchases quietly became five hundred

2
00:00:02,774 --> 00:00:05,238
dollars, and none of them felt like

3
00:00:05,308 --> 00:00:07,990
a decision. Twenty small purchases quietly became

4
00:00:08,060 --> 00:00:10,412
five hundred dollars by the end of

5
00:00:10,482 --> 00:00:12,834
the month. Each one felt too small

6
00:00:12,904 --> 00:00:14,540
to matter at the time.

7
00:00:14,760 --> 00:00:17,224
Left on a credit card, that balance

8
00:00:17,294 --> 00:00:19,756
grew from five hundred dollars to eight

9
00:00:19,826 --> 00:00:22,686
hundred and forty dollars, because interest compounds

10
00:00:22,756 --> 00:00:23,874
every single month.

11
00:00:24,094 --> 00:00:26,622
Paying the minimum costs three hundred and

12
00:00:26,692 --> 00:00:29,310
forty dollars in interest, but clearing it

13
00:00:29,380 --> 00:00:31,396
in full costs nothing at all.

14
00:00:31,616 --> 00:00:33,808
The purchases were never the problem.

15
00:00:34,028 --> 00:00:36,490
The balance you carry between months is

16
00:00:36,560 --> 00:00:38,014
what actually costs you.

